helpful for learning tenses. 📚

V1 (Base)	V2 (Past)	V3 (Past Participle)	Punjabi Meaning
Be	was/were	been	ਹੋਣਾ
Have	had	had	ਰੱਖਣਾ / ਕੋਲ ਹੋਣਾ
Do	did	done	ਕਰਨਾ
Go	went	gone	ਜਾਣਾ
Come	came	come	ਆਉਣਾ
Make	made	made	ਬਣਾਉਣਾ
Take	took	taken	ਲੈਣਾ
Give	gave	given	ਦੇਣਾ
See	saw	seen	ਦੇਖਣਾ
Know	knew	known	ਜਾਣਨਾ
Get	got	got/gotten	ਲੈਣਾ / ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰਨਾ
Find	found	found	ਲੱਭਣਾ
Think	thought	thought	ਸੋਚਣਾ
Tell	told	told	ਦੱਸਣਾ
Become	became	become	ਬਣ ਜਾਣਾ
Begin	began	begun	ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰਨਾ
Bring	brought	brought	ਲਿਆਉਣਾ
Buy	bought	bought	ਖਰੀਦਣਾ
Teach	taught	taught	ਸਿਖਾਉਣਾ
Write	wrote	written	ਲਿਖਣਾ
Speak	spoke	spoken	ਬੋਲਣਾ
Read	read	read	ਪੜ੍ਹਨਾ
Eat	ate	eaten	ਖਾਣਾ
Drink	drank	drunk	ਪੀਣਾ
Run	ran	run	ਦੌੜਣਾ
Drive	drove	driven	ਗੱਡੀ ਚਲਾਉਣਾ
Break	broke	broken	ਤੋੜਨਾ
Choose	chose	chosen	ਚੁਣਨਾ
Forget	forgot	forgotten	ਭੁੱਲਣਾ
Understand	understood	understood	ਸਮਝਣਾ
Example Sentences

I write a letter. → ਮੈਂ ਚਿੱਠੀ ਲਿਖਦਾ ਹਾਂ।

I wrote a letter. → ਮੈਂ ਚਿੱਠੀ ਲਿਖੀ।

I have written a letter. → ਮੈਂ ਚਿੱਠੀ ਲਿਖ ਚੁੱਕਾ ਹਾਂ।
